{%- comment -%}
  Naomi Katz Art: "Buy by bank transfer" button.
  Paste into the Product page template, directly under the Add to cart button.

  It only shows while the product is purchasable (status "active"). When an artwork is reserved,
  the portal hides the product on the store, so the whole page and this button disappear until
  the reservation ends.

  Set the portal address below: the Netlify address while testing, https://pay.naomikatzart.com live.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% if product.status == 'active' %}
  <a href="https://pay.naomikatzart.com/reserve/{{ product.id }}"
     style="display:block;margin-top:12px;padding:14px 18px;text-align:center;
            border:1px solid #d64fe7;border-radius:8px;color:#8a1c9b;
            font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">
    Buy by bank transfer
  </a>
{% endif %}
